OverTheWire Bandit: Level 16 → 17

Objective
Retrieve the password for Level 17.
A service running on localhost (ports 31000–32000) provides an SSH private key after a successful SSL connection.

Steps
Log in as bandit16:
ssh bandit16@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220
Scan for the SSL-enabled service:
nmap -p 31000-32000 localhost
Connect to the correct port using SSL:
openssl s_client -connect localhost:<port>
Paste the password for Bandit 16 to receive an SSH private key.
Save the key and set correct permissions:
chmod 600 key.txt
Use the key to log in as bandit17:
ssh bandit17@localhost -i key.txt

Result
Successful login grants access to Bandit Level 17.

